1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,313
The disagreement was about the ground itself, and it began with a tree.

2
00:00:04,313 --> 00:00:10,002
“You plant a dam and the sea takes the delta,” the ecologist said.

3
00:00:10,002 --> 00:00:14,001
“You leave the mud alone and the animal comes back.

4
00:00:14,001 --> 00:00:18,946
Both of us are against the fog of a single answer.”

5
00:00:18,946 --> 00:00:30,174
The cultural argument was harder: a branch of the ministry wanted a rock zone for the media, a planet-friendly slogan, and a mobile exhibition.

6
00:00:30,174 --> 00:00:36,568
“A bow and a fossil are worth more to a museum than to a river,” the director said.

7
00:00:36,568 --> 00:00:41,267
“We can be even more careful and still be late.”

8
00:00:41,267 --> 00:00:49,166
The scheme on the table had nothing to do with milk, pepper, or juice: it was about who owned the horizon.

9
00:00:49,166 --> 00:00:57,630
“If we wait for a scheme that protects the whole ecological axis, we will wait for ten years,” Lin said.

10
00:00:57,630 --> 00:01:03,909
“If we pull the scheme apart, we lose the peat and the shell beds.”

11
00:01:03,909 --> 00:01:16,612
The exploitation of the zone was already visible: a jet of warm water, a cube of concrete, a plague of algae, and a plough that turned the dew into dust.

12
00:01:16,612 --> 00:01:23,851
“The ecology of this zone is not a cultural ornament,” the ecologist said.

13
00:01:23,851 --> 00:01:28,796
The compromise they could live with was smaller than either side wanted.

14
00:01:28,796 --> 00:01:41,224
A leather boot, a wool blanket, a comb, and a packet of bacon were the whole of the field kit; from that list they reproduced a plan with a single branch.

15
00:01:41,224 --> 00:01:46,518
The end of the argument was that nothing was settled and everything was clearer.

16
00:01:46,518 --> 00:01:53,282
“We are able to measure a pollutant and not able to agree on a horizon,” the director said.

17
00:01:53,282 --> 00:02:08,270
“The next story will have to begin with that.” The mate of the ecologist brought bedding, corn, and a bag of peanut; the smog over the bank was the only thing at the low level of the river that the body could feel.

18
00:02:08,270 --> 00:02:14,139
The movement of the water and the result of the survey were on the same page for once.

19
00:02:14,139 --> 00:02:23,574
This planet has one river and one plan, and the plan must include both, unbuilt pier or not.
